      <div style="margin-top:3rem; padding:1.5rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:4px; text-align:center;">
        <p style="margin:0; opacity:0.65; font-size:0.9rem;">More photos to come. Follow us on <a href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank" style="color:#F2DF74;">Instagram</a> for the latest from our meetings.</p>
